# DEPLOYED PROFILE (reference): TP4 + EP4, 1M context, DSpark on, CUDA graphs on.
#
# Captured 2026-09-23 from the four-Spark deployment that is actually serving
# (sparks 10.0.1.1-.4; Ray head .2, vLLM server/TP driver .3 on :8002).
# Effective boot-log values: kv_cache_memory_bytes honored at 8.0 GiB (memory
# profiling skipped, so GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION below is inert), GPU KV cache
# 2,454,802 tokens, max concurrency 2.34x at a 1,048,576-token request.
#
# This is a *reference* profile, not a qualification gate: docs/TP4.md Gate 4
# still governs first boot (8192 / seq1 / eager / DSpark off / native off).
# Re-read docs/TP4.md "Deployed reference profile" before changing any value.
#
# Launch with:  set -a; . profiles/tp4-live-1m.env; set +a; bash scripts/serve_tp4.sh

IMAGE=deepseek-v41-exl3:fresh
MAX_MODEL_LEN=1048576
MAX_NUM_SEQS=4
MAX_NUM_BATCHED_TOKENS=4096
TEXT_ONLY=1
DSPARK=1
EAGER=0
NATIVE_MOE=0
MOE_PARALLEL_MODE=ep

# Manual KV budget. It replaces profiling entirely, which is why the
# utilization value below has no effect on this run; keep both lines only to
# document the deployed configuration, and pick one mechanism in new profiles.
KV_CACHE_MEMORY_BYTES=8589934592
GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=0.55

BLOCK_SIZE=128
PREFIX_CACHING=1

# DSpark draft block used by the deployment (the script default is 5).
NUM_SPECULATIVE_TOKENS=2
SPECULATIVE_QUANTIZATION=mxfp4

# Observed kernel selection: native kernel with the ABI-3 V4.1 native MoE path
# still OFF (AGENTS.md rule 6 keeps that path opt-in).
EXL3_MOE_KERNEL=native

# CUDA graphs: decode-only capture at the deployed batch shapes.
COMPILATION_CONFIG='{"cudagraph_mode":"FULL_DECODE_ONLY","cudagraph_capture_sizes":[3,6,9,12]}'

# Engram variants stay explicit (AGENTS.md rule 9).
#
# DISCREPANCY, unresolved: the captured launcher exported
# VLLM_ENGRAM_DISK_BACKED=1 but the container had NO VLLM_ENGRAM_MODEL_DIR, and
# the served config only carried `--engram-config {"cpu_offload":false}`. The
# disk-backed overlay therefore cannot have been reachable, and scripts/serve.sh
# fails closed on exactly that combination. It is left out of this profile until
# the maintainer confirms which mechanism the deployment actually intended.
# VLLM_ENGRAM_DISK_BACKED=1

# EXL3 execution tuning observed on the running workers.
VLLM_EXL3_ALLOW_SHAPE_MISMATCH=1
VLLM_EXL3_TRELLIS_ARENA=1
VLLM_EXL3_PADDED_MAX_T=32
VLLM_EXL3_PADDED_MAX_K=6
VLLM_EXL3_NATIVE_MOE_MAX_ROWS=32
VLLM_EXL3_MADV_AFTER_H2D=0
VLLM_EXL3_PREFETCH=populate
VLLM_EXL3_PAD_SO_CB=2

# Engram config for the deployed run (the deployment passes this same object).
EXTRA_VLLM_ARGS='--engram-config {"cpu_offload":false}'

# Required per deployment: exact materialized checkpoint path inside the container.
# MODEL=/models/dsv41-orig
